{"version":1,"content":"<p>《第63屆金馬獎頒獎典禮》今晚（22日）在台北流行音樂中心隆重舉行。</p><p>台灣女星翁倩玉憑《陽光女子合唱團》奪得最佳女配角獎，她上台領獎時更忍不住爆喊。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-22T12:24:16.260444+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":74,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-22T12:08:42+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-22T12:17:24.747308+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-22T12:17:24.747308+00:00","content_hash":"b996d7a244cec6f856592df5b9fe30a28ec0d4c60b669c82f015fe12550037fc","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}